sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Super Admin (Problem Setter)
    participant UI as Super Admin Authoring Workspace
    participant API as Platform API
    participant Judge as Coding Judge Worker
    participant Piston as Ephemeral Piston Sandbox
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (coding_problems)

    Admin->>UI: Fills Problem Statement (Markdown + KaTeX Math)
    Admin->>UI: Configures Constraints & Language Starters
    Admin->>UI: Defines Sample Cases & Hidden Boundary Cases
    Admin->>UI: Inputs Reference Solution (e.g. Canonical DP)
    Admin->>UI: Clicks "Verify Reference Solution"
    
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/coding/problems/verify
    API->>Judge: Dispatches code against 100% of test cases
    Judge->>Piston: Executes isolated sandboxed runs
    Piston-->>Judge: Raw stdout, stderr, timings, memory
    Judge-->>API: 10/10 Cases Passed (All verdicts: ACCEPTED)
    API-->>UI: Verification Success ("Solution 100% Validated")
    
    Admin->>UI: Clicks "Publish to Catalog"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/coding/problems
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO coding_problems (Single Row Atomic)
    DB-->>API: Row Created (id: knapsack-01)
    API-->>UI: Problem Published Successfully
    
    Admin->>UI: Clicks "Test Drive in Studio"
    UI->>UI: Launches Studio Preview Screen with Live PostgreSQL Data
